{"id":"n70341-1-9","stage":4,"title":"육로 · 陆路","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70341-1-9-1","ko":"명절에 고향에 어떻게 가야 할지 모르겠어.","zh":"我不知道节日期间要怎么回老家。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"명절에","meaning":"节日","explanation":"명절：节日；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"명절","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55441","senseId":"1","lemma":"명절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명절에","audio":"/audio/9a33da7e213414baa491.mp3"}},{"text":"고향에","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향에","audio":"/audio/a09c591b445023ab68e7.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"가야","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가야","audio":"/audio/6aca1779d1b3c7fc08b4.mp3"}},{"text":"할지","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할지","audio":"/audio/156fd116c75acec033e4.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7626dbdf4beacffb","term":"명절","zh":"节日","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3","entryId":"55441","definition":"春节、中秋等每年固定的传统庆祝日或纪念日。","pronunciation":["명절"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f300eefd8f588edadfd1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70341-1-9-2","ko":"육로는 시간이 너무 많이 걸리니까 비행기를 타자.","zh":"走陆路太费时间了，我们坐飞机吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"육로는","meaning":"陆路","explanation":"육로：陆路；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"육로","audio":"/audio/de827df03809f28c25c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70341","senseId":"1","lemma":"육로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"육로는","audio":"/audio/36087be687caad5590f9.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL K